{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n戀愛中究竟是甜言蜜語重要，還是實際行動更得人心？TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集就上演了「行動 vs. 言語」的殘酷對比。Alan因屢次開出「空頭支票」而令Amber大感失望，另一邊廂，第一季的Yuki則大方分享男友Kris如何用窩心行動證明真心，強烈對比引發熱議。\n</p>\n<h2>Alan得把口激嬲Amber 兩度失信遭怒斥</h2>\n<p>節目中，當Amber在水戰中被Yvette箍頸時，Alan事後聲稱很想「英雄救美」，卻被Amber即場吐槽：「你就係得個口，你就係冇行動咯！」連Maggie都忍不住附和：「抵鬧啦！」原來這已非Alan首次「得把口」，他早前在「心跳電話亭」已表示忘記帶準備好的禮物給Amber，而這份神秘禮物至今依然「冇下文」。連番失信令Amber極度失望，事後她在訪問中坦言：「我嘅 Love Language 係行動多過言語，好似你講咗但你唔做，我唔會知係真定假。」一語道破兩人關係的癥結所在。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_3169749076ae805fb0ea9e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_3169749076ae805fb0ea9e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8071623856ae806006be2b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8071623856ae806006be2b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10894549886ae8060341234.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10894549886ae8060341234.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Yuki甜笑憶Kris窩心行動 煲湯沖咖啡證愛意</h2>\n<p>相對於Alan的空談，第一季成功配對的Yuki則以親身經歷，證明行動的重要性。當Yuki聽到Amber的困擾後，她隨即以自己和男友Kris做例子，分享時更全程流露甜絲絲的表情。她憶述：「初頭係好質疑佢，會唔會係搏曝光，唔係真心過嚟呢？但三角枱完咗後，佢慢慢有用行動去證明。」Yuki甜蜜細數Kris的窩心舉動：「嗰時 Camping 佢有煲湯水畀我飲，第二日又早咗起身手沖咖啡畀我，呢啲位令我慢慢開始相信佢。」這些看似微不足道的細節，卻是融化芳心的關鍵。</p>\n<h2>Kris做跟得男友陪錄影 網民大讚世一好男友</h2>\n<p>整集最大的彩蛋，莫過於Kris的驚喜現身。原來在錄影當日，Kris雖然完全沒有出鏡任務，但依然做「跟得男友」陪伴Yuki工作一整天，在旁觀看時更不時流露寵溺的笑容，用最實際的陪伴來支持女友。這個幕後花絮完美印證了「行動勝於雄辯」的戀愛真理。網民看到此幕都大為感動，紛紛留言：「Alan真係得把口，Amber快啲走啦！」、「Kris同Yuki好Sweet呀！呢啲先係真愛！」、「行動真係最重要，講咁多都冇用。」、「見到Kris喺後面陪Yuki，真係好感動！Kris絕對係世一好男友！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_16852763796ae8060615ba1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_16852763796ae8060615ba1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_10735745126ae8060a50f9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_10735745126ae8060a50f9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_15361973866ae8060d4971c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 yuki （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_15361973866ae8060d4971c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:45.336893+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1198,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:20:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:14.657651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:14.977525+00:00","content_hash":"f50b7daca05d215405e08a6089a965bf2ccb57126c524502093e3369dd53b10e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}